  spqlios/       The SPQLIOS negacyclic FFT, from TFHE v1.0
                 (src/libtfhe/fft_processors/spqlios/).
                 spqlios-fft-fma.s, spqlios-ifft-fma.s, spqlios-fft-impl.cpp
                 and spqlios-fft.h are unmodified.
                 fft_processor_spqlios.cpp, lagrangehalfc_impl.h and
                 lagrangehalfc_impl_fma.s have been modified: 64-bit torus
                 entry points (execute_direct_torus64 / execute_reverse_torus64)
                 were added alongside the original 32-bit ones.

  src/64header.h Derived from TFHE v1.0. The ciphertext and polynomial
                 operations were re-expressed to operate on 64-bit torus
                 elements, and only the routines needed by sPAR were kept.

All other files in this repository are original work of the sPAR authors.
